":"Doctor Jacques Vernon","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hR1FDjGRayBQtK3xIgDWdyYwYkO.jpg"},{"id":2137819,"name":"Brigitte Juslin","role":"Juliette (uncredited)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Occhi senza volto","overview":"In seguito ad un incidente stradale, Christine ha avuto il volto completamente sfigurato. Il padre, che dirige una clinica, è ossessionato dall’idea di trovare una rimedio alla trasfigurazione della figlia."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Eyes Without a Face","overview":"Dr. Génessier is riddled with guilt after an accident that he caused disfigures the face of his daughter, the once beautiful Christiane, who outsiders believe is dead. Dr. Génessier, along with accomplice and laboratory assistant Louise, kidnaps young women and brings them to the Génessier mansion. After rendering his victims unconscious, Dr. Génessier removes their faces and attempts to graft them on to Christiane's.","tagline":"The horror film with a heart of mystery."},{"language":"fr-FR","title":"Les Yeux sans visage","overview":"Le professeur Génessier, célèbre chirurgien spécialisé dans les transplantations, est responsable d'un accident de voiture dont sa fille Christiane, qu'il adore, est sortie vivante mais le visage horriblement mutilé. À l'aide d'une assistante dévouée, il attire des jeunes filles dans son pavillon-laboratoire, pour prélever la peau de leur visage et l'appliquer sur les plaies de sa fille. Une opération si difficile que Génessier est obligé de la répéter régulièrement, après chaque échec des greffons. Christiane, un masque sur le visage, ne se doute encore de rien...","tagline":"De belles femmes ont été les victimes de ses soins du visage diaboliques."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nZceGCs2OAfQXpPAxyy2Yb0VQWf.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wlqwUNYHMuswEdGo3nSZ9i0LIlc.jpg",